    "Every photo here is Creative Commons and must keep its credit visible —",
    "that is the licence condition, not a nicety. `credit` and `licence` are",
    "required before a photo is allowed to ship: the fetcher refuses to enable",
    "a photo with an unknown photographer, because attributing someone else's",
    "picture to the wrong person is worse than having no picture.",
    "",
    "`enabled: false` means the file may download but will not be built in.",
    "Fill in the credit, flip the flag, re-run the fetcher and the build."
